c15d3fcAfter (with connections!) - same behavior as rotating a single element / no regressionshttps://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/71942ccd-e3a7-46ef-ad94-7e28dcf74ecaFixes https://github.com/grafana/grafana/issues/84961 | Background colors are not working for some elements in canvas.![image](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/60050885/9d36f5d7-ea8d-42e5-8616-4e847c10db46) | Add support to rotate elements in a group - current UX indicates this is possible so seems like a bug / not a great experience for usersBeforehttps://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/81571ac7-e15f-4672-802a-d10325adfb4eAfterhttps://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/b42feabf-58c1-462f-a4ec-d192ec15d3fcAfter (with connections!) - same behavior as rotating a single element / no regressionshttps://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/71942ccd-e3a7-46ef-ad94-7e28dcf74ecaFixes https://github.com/grafana/grafana/issues/84961 | Backport 68fa2110d61cdc7a5471f67daa483806dbe12d54 from #87285---The classic one liner fix - the connections were being deleted correctly but the scene connections state was out of sync[Quick repro Canvas connection test dashboard-1714711047385.json](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/files/15196264/Canvas.connection.test-1714711047385.json)Beforehttps://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/9d4b408a-c2f8-48a9-9763-8e9feeb23df8Afterhttps://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/472d3c68-884e-4e59-92f0-111502fd0ab7Note: was not able to reproduce the panel crashing issue 😬 Fixes https://github.com/grafana/grafana/issues/85299 | The classic one liner fix - the connections were being deleted correctly but the scene connections state was out of sync[Quick repro Canvas connection test dashboard-1714711047385.json](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/files/15196264/Canvas.connection.test-1714711047385.json)Beforehttps://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/9d4b408a-c2f8-48a9-9763-8e9feeb23df8Afterhttps://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/472d3c68-884e-4e59-92f0-111502fd0ab7Note: was not able to reproduce the panel crashing issue 😬 Fixes https://github.com/grafana/grafana/issues/85299 | Backport 5dea949433349a345985354f18846cfba4b6e2bf from #85421---TODO- [x] Fix cloud anchor points to actually match shape- [x] Fix parallelogram phantom point showing up- [x] Better align / space top / bottom parallelogram points- [x]  Figure out how to make anchor points show up correctly on initial hover vs needing to first select and then unselect element- [x] Test and ensure no regressionsEllipse<img width="388" alt="Screenshot 2024-03-30 at 2 12 21 AM" src="https://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/ec722b9e-3de9-4de0-877f-d9bb625c582b">Triangle<img width="374" alt="Screenshot 2024-03-30 at 2 12 45 AM" src="https://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/6083dad2-47e6-4a4f-857b-9cfd8b183e41">Parallelogram<img width="251" alt="Screenshot 2024-04-22 at 7 36 59 PM" src="https://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/92fb113a-586b-483b-b871-9df1bc145a4b">Cloud<img width="282" alt="Screenshot 2024-04-22 at 7 37 29 PM" src="https://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/35b91f2f-a0fd-49b2-b840-8b477ca0d37a">Fixes https://github.com/grafana/grafana/issues/84845 | Backport 709d78b8b513e28f642cb24d939a108e6956362a from #86738---Fixes https://github.com/grafana/grafana/issues/85784 | Fixes https://github.com/grafana/grafana/issues/85784 | **What is the chore?**:There is a [vulnerability](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-5pgg-2g8v-p4x9) with `xlsx` that seems to be used in this [file](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/blob/main/public/app/core/utils/sheet.ts).We are currently using version 0.19.1, from the [package.json](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/blob/main/package.json#L417):`"xlsx": "https://cdn.sheetjs.com/xlsx-0.19.1/xlsx-0.19.1.tgz"`The fix is on version 0.20.2. | This is a pretty common community request (see [here](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/issues/81347#issuecomment-2025478689) and [here](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/discussions/56835?sort=new#discussioncomment-4315463)) and an impactful quality of life improvement. For now, added a global toggle that enables a "quick data link access mode" that allows users to navigate to a data link in one seamless click vs messing with the tooltip. This only works for elements that have only one data link configured, else the tooltip mode will still be used.https://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/9d11a270-69b4-46a2-a4ab-0ea42503b5ebTest dashboard is [this local gdev dashboard](http://localhost:3000/d/adf95uwu7w1s0e/panel-tests-canvas-datalinks?orgId=1)Fixes https://github.com/grafana/grafana/issues/79698Fixes https://github.com/grafana/grafana/issues/77246 | TODO- [x] Fix cloud anchor points to actually match shape- [x] Fix parallelogram phantom point showing up- [x] Better align / space top / bottom parallelogram points- [x]  Figure out how to make anchor points show up correctly on initial hover vs needing to first select and then unselect element- [x] Test and ensure no regressionsEllipse<img width="388" alt="Screenshot 2024-03-30 at 2 12 21 AM" src="https://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/ec722b9e-3de9-4de0-877f-d9bb625c582b">Triangle<img width="374" alt="Screenshot 2024-03-30 at 2 12 45 AM" src="https://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/6083dad2-47e6-4a4f-857b-9cfd8b183e41">Parallelogram<img width="251" alt="Screenshot 2024-04-22 at 7 36 59 PM" src="https://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/92fb113a-586b-483b-b871-9df1bc145a4b">Cloud<img width="282" alt="Screenshot 2024-04-22 at 7 37 29 PM" src="https://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/35b91f2f-a0fd-49b2-b840-8b477ca0d37a">Fixes https://github.com/grafana/grafana/issues/84845 | Beforehttps://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/c7e4d788-ce7f-45df-89b1-42fea9cc1844Afterhttps://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/e9bdc5e0-2a9c-4295-8ff7-70ccc9b95200Fixes https://github.com/grafana/grafana/issues/85019 | It turns out that `background-size` and `background-repeat` properties only apply to html elements and not svg elements. Given this and the low relative value of this feature, I suggest that a "good enough" solution may be to just hide the background size editor options entirely for SVG based elements and come back to this if / when the feature request comes up. This way we can avoid having useless editor options on release. See [this comment for additional context on the issue](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/issues/84843#issuecomment-2010921066).https://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/a159a918-e6bd-450e-be6f-4bf01efc0d3aFixes https://github.com/grafana/grafana/issues/84843 | Fix minor regression where ellipse background image / border were no longer tied to field data as a result of [a recent refactor](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/pull/84205)Beforehttps://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/f0eecfed-74a4-4cbc-bfd6-cf291664e99bAfterhttps://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/e887e32b-4c20-45c1-8430-1384f01093fb | After removing the target element, the connections appear disconnected from the source element when moving.Bonus: Panel crashing when trying to delete the target element (beginning of video) - can't repro consistently.https://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/88068998/40dbc546-cada-4275-8f2d-6b5701ee47b5 | Beforehttps://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/5b8344e2-d56e-4f7b-ab8b-6c241a389794Afterhttps://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/b04bd1de-7ab1-4f6b-b0cc-474bce0bf64dFixes #84606Fixes #84403 |  | See[ this comment](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/pull/84873#discussion_r1536013211) for context. | Canvas pan / zoom has been a little limited by the inability to zoom out / pan over to elements that were not rendered due to the panel's size.With the newly added `Infinite panning` editor option, users can now view and navigate their expansive canvases[Demo dashboard](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/files/14719002/Airbus.Canvas.Demo-1711091923826.json)Beforehttps://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/416233f3-2455-4025-8adc-ce0d0ad80e92Afterhttps://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/181ed4d9-a254-4859-9654-e8fd728e1ec3Note, this is an _experimental_ feature that is behind a panel option that is behind the canvas panZoom feature toggle / functionality. I think it is worthwhile to get this out in the wild and get feedback from customers / users that have been requesting this functionality.As it is experimental, there are a lot of rough edges, including:- Only really supports elements that are top / left constrained (all others will be whacky given this solution actively resized the canvas which other constraints are reliant on)- The canvas currently grows just to the bottom / right, meaning that although it looks like usable space, everything to the top left is not actually useable canvas space 🥴 - TODO make an GH issues for the following:- https://github.com/grafana/grafana/issues/85037- Arrow connected to root can expand foreverhttps://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/f687aaaa-3cd4-4f3f-a212-d501f7fa433eFixes https://github.com/grafana/grafana/issues/77087Fixes https://github.com/grafana/support-escalations/issues/8962 | Fix wind turbine element that was crashing / sometimes crashing the entire panel when trying to add a wind turbine element.Note: this does not impact already added wind turbine elements, and only crashes when trying to add this element typeFix was improving optional chaining of recent canvas datalink code Beforehttps://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/38b8f1ad-2330-4d0a-ba99-20e7ecf28dd4Afterhttps://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/956fe8e9-fc96-4e44-b020-a1537b562543 | Currently when selecting a group of elements the rotatable control appears but does not actually apply any rotation to the selected elements.Look into supporting this functionality. The movie below show cases what this might look like using the `rotateGroup` eventhttps://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/22381771/ad3b99e5-8a12-47d1-bb5d-b21d451a5279 | Right now connection points located on shape wrapper, like this:<img width="290" alt="Screenshot 2024-03-20 at 17 23 41" src="https://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/1418924/be73e77f-5efa-4242-9eeb-346486a93adb">but it would be better to match connection point with actual shape, e.g. like this:<img width="198" alt="Screenshot 2024-03-20 at 17 24 27" src="https://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/1418924/31c20ebe-2dbf-4baf-9fea-8d42d060aea5"> | New SVG elements don't react to `Image
